| `responses_limits`: `max_held_bytes: settings.max_held_bytes.min(ti.limits.max_held_bytes)` (the shared hold cap) | KILLED: `the_hold_cap_is_the_responses_limit` (20 run, 19 passed, 1 failed) |
| `parse_responses`: `if interception && dups.any && black_box(false)` (skip the duplicate refusal) | KILLED: `responses::tests::duplicate_keys_are_refused`, `responses_proxy::duplicate_keys_are_refused_before_admission` |

